/// plot — Terminal-based visualization library
///
/// Provides ASCII/Unicode plotting for scientific data visualization
/// directly in the terminal. No external dependencies.
///
/// ## Modules
///
/// - `canvas` — Drawing primitives, box characters, shading
/// - `color` — ANSI color support
/// - `scatter` — Scatter plots
/// - `line` — Line charts
/// - `bar` — Bar charts
/// - `heatmap` — 2D heatmaps with color gradients
/// - `epistemic` — Uncertainty-aware plots (Knowledge<T> visualization)
/// - `plot3d` — Interactive 3D plots (WebGL HTML output)
///
/// ## Quick Start
///
/// ```sio
/// use plot::scatter
/// use plot::line
///
/// fn main() with IO, Mut {
///     // Individual modules provide plotting functions
/// }
/// ```

// Re-export modules — use `use plot::scatter`, `use plot::line`, etc.
